{
 "title": "Today",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Today",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c515",
     "shot": "g515",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Israel in early 2023 is deeply divided",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c516",
     "shot": "g516",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "with months of mass protests over a plan to weaken the courts.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c517",
     "shot": "g517",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then on the morning of October 7th, 2023,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c518",
     "shot": "g518",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a Saturday and a Jewish holiday,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c519",
     "shot": "g519",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Hamas led fighters break through the Gaza border fence.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c520",
     "shot": "g520",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "They kill about 1200 people, most of them civilians",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c521",
     "shot": "g521",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "in farming communities and at a music festival,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c522",
     "shot": "g522",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "it is the deadliest single day for Jews",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c523",
     "shot": "g523",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "since the Holocaust.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c524",
     "shot": "g524",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And they take 251 people hostage into Gaza.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c525",
     "shot": "g525",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Israel declares war on Hamas.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c526",
     "shot": "g526",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The campaign that follows is the most destructive",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c527",
     "shot": "g527",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "in Gaza's history.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c528",
     "shot": "g528",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "According to Gaza's health ministry,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c529",
     "shot": "g529",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "part of the Hamas run government,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c530",
     "shot": "g530",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "more than 74,000 Palestinians have been killed",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c531",
     "shot": "g531",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "about half of them women and children.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c532",
     "shot": "g532",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The ministry does not separate civilians from fighters.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c533",
     "shot": "g533",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "UN agencies generally consider its counts reliable.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c534",
     "shot": "g534",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Israel disputes them.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c535",
     "shot": "g535",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Most of Gaza's two million people have been displaced,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c536",
     "shot": "g536",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "many of them more than once",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c537",
     "shot": "g537",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and much of its housing, hospitals and water systems",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c538",
     "shot": "g538",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "are destroyed.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c539",
     "shot": "g539",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Israel says it is fighting an enemy",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c540",
     "shot": "g540",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "that hides among civilians",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c541",
     "shot": "g541",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and that its goal is to destroy Hamas",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c542",
     "shot": "g542",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and bring the hostages home.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c543",
     "shot": "g543",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Its critics say the cost to civilians",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c544",
     "shot": "g544",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "is far beyond what any goal can justify.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c545",
     "shot": "g545",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Courts and scholars are still weighing the gravest charges",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c546",
     "shot": "g546",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and a film cannot settle that for them.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c547",
     "shot": "g547",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The war spreads.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c548",
     "shot": "g548",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Hezbollah in Lebanon fires on Northern Israel",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c549",
     "shot": "g549",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and in 2024, Israel and Hezbollah fight a war",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c550",
     "shot": "g550",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "that ends in a ceasefire that November.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c551",
     "shot": "g551",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In June 2025, Israel and Iran trade strikes",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c552",
     "shot": "g552",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "for 12 days with the United States",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c553",
     "shot": "g553",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "joining in against Iran's nuclear sites.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c554",
     "shot": "g554",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In October 2025, after two years of war,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c555",
     "shot": "g555",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a ceasefire brokered by the United States takes hold",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c556",
     "shot": "g556",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and the remaining hostages are returned.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c557",
     "shot": "g557",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But a year later, its hardest parts are stuck.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c558",
     "shot": "g558",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Who governs Gaza, whether Hamas disarms",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c559",
     "shot": "g559",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and when Israeli forces withdraw?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c560",
     "shot": "g560",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Most people in Gaza are still living in tents and rubble",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c561",
     "shot": "g561",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and in Israel, an election in October, 2026",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c562",
     "shot": "g562",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "has left the political picture unsettled",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c563",
     "shot": "g563",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "as this is written.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c564",
     "shot": "g564",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So where does that leave us?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c565",
     "shot": "g565",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Israel today is a country of about 10 million people.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c566",
     "shot": "g566",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Roughly three in four are Jewish and about one in five",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c567",
     "shot": "g567",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "is Arab.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c568",
     "shot": "g568",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The world has about 15 million Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c569",
     "shot": "g569",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "with Israel and the United States",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c570",
     "shot": "g570",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "each home to six or seven million.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c571",
     "shot": "g571",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Millions of Palestinians live in the West Bank",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c572",
     "shot": "g572",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "in Gaza and in Jordan, Lebanon and beyond.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c573",
     "shot": "g573",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember the question from the beginning,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c574",
     "shot": "g574",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "why does almost nobody have the whole story",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c575",
     "shot": "g575",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "because it is two true stories?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c576",
     "shot": "g576",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "One is about a people who were driven from their home,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c577",
     "shot": "g577",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "scattered, hunted, nearly erased",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c578",
     "shot": "g578",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and who rebuilt a country in a land",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c579",
     "shot": "g579",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "they never stopped praying toward.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c580",
     "shot": "g580",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The other is about a people who were living on that land",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c581",
     "shot": "g581",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "whose homes and villages were lost in the making of that country",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c582",
     "shot": "g582",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and who still have no state of their own.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c583",
     "shot": "g583",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Each story is true and for the people who live it,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c584",
     "shot": "g584",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "each one is a story of survival.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c585",
     "shot": "g585",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "4,000 years ago, a man walked into Canaan with a promise.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c586",
     "shot": "g586",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A people lost their home, kept their book",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c587",
     "shot": "g587",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and found each other again.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c588",
     "shot": "g588",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Another people have held on to their homes,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c589",
     "shot": "g589",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "their keys and their names through exile and occupation.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c590",
     "shot": "g590",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Whether those two stories can be lived side by side",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c591",
     "shot": "g591",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "is the one page nobody has written yet.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}